          "title": "You'll want to know: ஏற்படுத்து",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஏற்படுத்து — ēṟpaṭuttu — \"to cause; to bring about\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அந்தச் செய்தி மக்களிடையே குழப்பத்தை ஏற்படுத்தியது. antac ceyti makkaḷiṭaiyē kuḻappattai ēṟpaṭuttiyatu. That news caused confusion among the people."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ஏற்படுத்தினேன், ēṟpaṭuttiṉēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The result takes -ஐ: குழப்பத்தை ஏற்படுத்து (ēṟpaṭuttu). Its intransitive partner is ஏற்படு, to come about."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஏற்படுத்து (ēṟpaṭuttu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 905 lists Tamil ēṟpaṭuttu, \"to create, establish\", beside ēṟpaṭu, \"to come into existence\", both from ēl, \"to happen, to receive\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
