          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பாதி (pāti), \"to affect\", is a verb built on the Sanskrit root bādh-, \"to press, oppress, harass\" (Monier-Williams). Tamil writes the Sanskrit b as ப."
